<title>USA: SBC Warburg hires Hough for trade finance post.</title>
<headline>SBC Warburg hires Hough for trade finance post.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg, a unit of Swiss Bank Corp, said Wednesday it hired Gordon Hough to be a director in its global trade finance group in New York.</p>
<p>SBC Warburg said Hough will be responsible for marketing glboal trade finance services to U.S. corporations.</p>
<p>Hough had been director and head of structured export finance, North America, for the BZW unit of Barclays Plc.</p>
